    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im still feeling pretty rough. the 500mg stuff isnt really touching this fever and the headache is getting worse, it's even making me feel a bit nauseous. i really dont want to deal with the hospital or anything, can i just take a full 1000mg dose of tylenol to get some relief? i feel like i just need one big dose to knock this out so i can sleep.",
